Description: Event-driven Unisoc SIM detection through the existing MM owner
 Confirm ECIND type 3 with CPIN before using the existing SIM swap lifecycle.
 Retain the AT port to receive insertion events while no SIM is installed.
 No polling, radio resets or extra normal initialization commands.
Author: e5-linux
Forwarded: no

